  "goodToKnow": "Die Druckerei is a printing works or print shop. Johannes Gutenberg developed printing with movable metal type in Mainz around 1450, one of the most important inventions in history; the Gutenberg Museum in Mainz shows original Bibles. Der Drucker is a printer (machine or person), and drucken means to print, while drücken means to press: Drücken Sie den Knopf. Plural: die Druckereien."
